{"version":1,"key":"card:127","content":{"id":127,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Shell 函数的返回值，函数的退出状态码是最后一条执行语句的退出状态码，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"$?","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以拿到"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"#!/bin/zsh\n\nlist_file() {\n    ls\n    # this file is not exists \n    ls -l dad\n}\n\nlist_file\necho \"function exit status is $?.\"","language":"bash","uuid":"5c89d3e0-812f-42b9-8d67-8a3d2f31c1c5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"xt in ~/shell/func λ ./02.sh\n01.sh  02.sh\nls: cannot access 'dad': No such file or directory\nfunction exit status is 2.","language":"bash","uuid":"f75c45a3-fbad-4a0b-a55d-fbfa333ebdee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"return","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令也可以返回特定的退出码"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"#!/bin/zsh\n\nrr() {\n    val=1\n    return $[ $val * 5 ]\n}\n\nrr\n\necho \"exit status: $?.\"","language":"bash","uuid":"30b9b20e-1b0c-40ba-84de-c6b5006083de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"xt in ~/shell/func λ ./03.sh\nexit status: 5.","language":"bash","uuid":"9f0f3bcc-02a5-41f6-baef-a5adc96933a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"获取函数输出"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"dd() {\n    value=200\n    echo $[ $value * 3 ]\n}\n\nres=$(dd)\n# 600\necho \"$res\"","language":"bash","uuid":"91ef7cd5-f434-42c9-86cd-c993ef01426b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Shell编程/函数"],"createTime":1689258369396,"updateTime":1743303640393,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640393}}